<section class="panel spaced"><div class="panel-head"><div><b>Proveedores configurados</b><small>Selecciona cuál usar. Puedes conservar Graph y SMTP configurados al mismo tiempo.</small></div></div><div class="mail-profile-grid"><?php if(!$profiles):?><div class="empty-compact"><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope-circle-check"></i><b>Sin proveedores guardados</b><span>Completa el formulario para crear el primero.</span></div><?php else:foreach($profiles as $mp):?><article class="mail-profile <?=$mp['is_default']?'active':''?>"><span class="mail-provider-icon"><i class="fa-solid <?=$mp['metodo_envio']==='GRAPH'?'fa-cloud':'fa-server'?>"></i></span><div><b><?=htmlspecialchars($mp['metodo_envio']==='GRAPH'?'Microsoft Graph':'SMTP')?></b><small><?=htmlspecialchars($mp['metodo_envio']==='GRAPH'?($mp['graph_user']?:'Sin buzón'):($mp['correo']?:$mp['server']))?></small></div><span class="status <?=$mp['is_default']?'ok':''?>"><?=$mp['is_default']?'En uso':'Disponible'?></span><div class="mail-profile-actions"><?php if(!$mp['is_default']):?><button class="soft email-activate" data-id="<?=$mp['correo_id']?>"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Usar / editar</button><button class="soft danger email-delete" data-id="<?=$mp['correo_id']?>"><i class="fa-solid fa-trash"></i></button><?php else:?><button class="soft" type="button" onclick="const el=document.getElementById('mailMethod'); const y=el.getBoundingClientRect().top+window.scrollY-110; window.scrollTo({top:y,behavior:'smooth'}); setTimeout(()=>el.focus(),350)"><i class="fa-solid fa-pen"></i> Editar</button><?php endif?></div></article><?php endforeach;endif?></div></section>
<form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="email_save"><section class="panel spaced"><div class="panel-head"><div><b>Proveedor de envío</b><small>Las credenciales sensibles se guardan cifradas. Deja una contraseña/secret vacío para conservar el existente.</small></div></div><div class="settings-grid"><div class="field"><label>Método de envío</label><select class="select2" id="mailMethod" name="method"><option value="SMTP" <?=$method==='SMTP'?'selected':''?>>SMTP</option><option value="GRAPH" <?=$method==='GRAPH'?'selected':''?>>Microsoft Graph</option></select></div><div class="field smtp-fields"><label>Correo emisor SMTP</label><input name="sender" type="email" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($cfg['correo']??'')?>"></div></div><div class="mail-fields smtp-fields settings-grid"><div class="field"><label>Servidor SMTP</label><input name="server" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($cfg['server']??'')?>" placeholder="smtp.office365.com"></div><div class="field"><label>Puerto</label><input name="port" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($cfg['port']??'587')?>" inputmode="numeric"></div><div class="field"><label>Seguridad</label><select class="select2" name="smtp_secure"><option value="tls" <?=($cfg['smtp_secure']??'tls')==='tls'?'selected':''?>>TLS</option><option value="ssl" <?=($cfg['smtp_secure']??'')==='ssl'?'selected':''?>>SSL</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>Contraseña / App password</label><input name="smtp_password" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="<?=empty($cfg['password'])?'Obligatoria':'•••••••• (conservar si queda vacío)'?>"></div></div><div class="mail-fields graph-fields settings-grid" hidden><div class="field"><label>Tenant ID</label><input name="graph_tenant" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($cfg['tenant_graph_id']??'')?>"></div><div class="field"><label>Client ID</label><input name="client_id" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($cfg['client_id']??'')?>"></div><div class="field"><label>Buzón de Microsoft Graph (Graph User / correo emisor)</label><input name="graph_user" type="email" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($cfg['graph_user']??'')?>"></div><div class="field"><label>Guardar en enviados</label><label class="switch-line"><input name="save_to_sent" type="checkbox" <?=($cfg['save_to_sent_items']??1)?'checked':''?>><span></span>Activado</label></div><div class="field full"><label>Client Secret</label><input name="client_secret" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="<?=empty($cfg['client_secret'])?'Obligatorio':'•••••••• (conservar si queda vacío)'?>"></div></div><div class="settings-grid"><div class="field"><label>Destino interno predeterminado</label><input name="recipient" type="email" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($cfg['destinatario']??'')?>" placeholder="Opcional"></div><div class="field"><label>Copia oculta (BCC)</label><input name="bcc" value="<?=htmlspecialchars($cfg['copia']??'')?>" placeholder="correo1@dominio.com; correo2@dominio.com"></div></div><div class="actions-inline mail-config-actions"><button class="soft" type="button" id="testConfiguredMail"><i class="fa-solid fa-paper-plane"></i> Probar correo</button><button class="primary" type="submit"><i class="fa-solid fa-floppy-disk"></i> Guardar configuración</button><span class="hint">La prueba usa el proveedor activo guardado y la plantilla premium oficial.</span></div></section></form>
<form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="notification_settings_save"><section class="panel spaced"><div class="panel-head"><div><b>Notificaciones automáticas</b><small>Elige qué eventos generan correo. Los mensajes se agrupan para evitar saturar la bandeja.</small></div></div><div class="settings-grid notification-settings-grid"><div class="field"><label>Seguridad</label><label class="switch-line"><input name="login_enabled" type="checkbox" <?=!empty($notif['login_enabled'])?'checked':''?>><span></span> Inicios de sesión</label></div><div class="field"><label>Conversaciones</label><label class="switch-line"><input name="message_enabled" type="checkbox" <?=!empty($notif['message_enabled'])?'checked':''?>><span></span> Nuevos mensajes</label></div><div class="field"><label>NIVO</label><label class="switch-line"><input name="handoff_enabled" type="checkbox" <?=!empty($notif['handoff_enabled'])?'checked':''?>><span></span> Solicitudes de agente</label></div><div class="field"><label>Sistema</label><label class="switch-line"><input name="critical_enabled" type="checkbox" <?=!empty($notif['critical_enabled'])?'checked':''?>><span></span> Eventos críticos</label></div><div class="field full notification-cooldown"><label>Agrupar mensajes durante</label><select class="select2" name="cooldown_minutes"><option value="0" <?=$notif['cooldown_minutes']==0?'selected':''?>>Sin agrupación</option><option value="5" <?=$notif['cooldown_minutes']==5?'selected':''?>>5 minutos</option><option value="10" <?=$notif['cooldown_minutes']==10?'selected':''?>>10 minutos · recomendado</option><option value="15" <?=$notif['cooldown_minutes']==15?'selected':''?>>15 minutos</option><option value="30" <?=$notif['cooldown_minutes']==30?'selected':''?>>30 minutos</option><option value="60" <?=$notif['cooldown_minutes']==60?'selected':''?>>1 hora</option></select><small class="hint">Si una conversación recibe varios mensajes en este período, ZYNKO envía solo la primera alerta.</small></div></div><div class="notification-actions"><button class="primary" type="submit"><i class="fa-solid fa-bell"></i> Guardar notificaciones</button><span class="hint"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i> Usa el proveedor activo configurado arriba.</span></div></section></form>
<section class="panel spaced"><div class="panel-head"><div><b>Estado</b><small><?=empty($cfg)?'Correo no configurado: no se enviarán emails hasta guardar un proveedor.':'Proveedor guardado: '.htmlspecialchars($method).'.'?></small></div></div></section>
<script>document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',()=>{document.getElementById('testConfiguredMail')?.addEventListener('click',async()=>{const b=document.getElementById('testConfiguredMail'),old=b.innerHTML;b.disabled=true;b.innerHTML='<i class="fa-solid fa-spinner fa-spin"></i> Enviando prueba…';try{const fd=new FormData();fd.append('action','email_test');const r=await fetch(location.href,{method:'POST',headers:{'X-ZYNKO-AJAX':'1'},body:fd});const j=await r.json();showNotify(j.ok?'success':'error',j.ok?'Correo verificado':'No se pudo enviar',j.message)}catch(e){showNotify('error','No se pudo enviar',e.message)}finally{b.disabled=false;b.innerHTML=old}});const m=document.getElementById('mailMethod'),ss=[...document.querySelectorAll('.smtp-fields')],gs=[...document.querySelectorAll('.graph-fields')];const sync=()=>{const graph=m.value==='GRAPH';ss.forEach(s=>{s.hidden=graph;s.querySelectorAll('input,select').forEach(e=>e.disabled=graph)});gs.forEach(g=>{g.hidden=!graph;g.querySelectorAll('input,select').forEach(e=>e.disabled=!graph)});};m.addEventListener('change',sync);sync();});</script>
